Taylor</surname><given-names>PR</given-names></name><name><surname>Mark</surname><given-names>SD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Tooth loss is associated with increased risk of total death and death from upper gastrointestinal cancer, heart disease, and stroke in a Chinese population-based cohort</article-title><source>Int J Epidemiol</source><year>2005</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>467</fpage><lpage>474</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15659476</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/ije/dyh375</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Morrison</surname><given-names>HI</given-names></name><name><surname>Ellison</surname><given-names>LF</given-names></name><name><surname>Taylor</surname><given-names>GW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Periodontal disease and risk of fatal coronary heart and cerebrovascular diseases</article-title><source>J Cardiovasc Risk</source><year>1999</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>7</fpage><lpage>11</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10197286</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Elter</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Offenbacher</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Toole</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><name><surname>Beck</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Relationship of periodontal disease and edentulism to stroke/TIA</article-title><source>J Dent Res</source><year>2003</year><volume>82</volume><fpage>998</fpage><lpage>1001</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14630902</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1177/154405910308201212</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Garcia</sur